('Kinetic Ripples', 'Motorized kinetic sculpture.', 'Eventually, this will be a motorized kinetic sculpture that simulates ripples radiating from a droplet, using 100 oscilating plexiglass cylinders', 'http://gennetten.com/images/Kinetics/KineticRipples.jpg', 'WIPkinetics', 0, 0, NULL),
