('Kinetic Ripples (view on desktop -- having issues with mobile', 'Motorized kinetic sculpture.', 'Imagine a 1 inch diameter 8 inch high cylinder, oscillating up and down at 1Hz. Now imagine 100 of them, each hanging from one of the hundred tiny holes you see, all oscillating to form a radiating ripple pattern.', 'http://gennetten.com/images/Kinetics/KineticRipples2.mp4', 'WIPkinetics', 2, 0, NULL),
